1	/**
2	 * ============================================================================
3	 * Aircraft Maintenance Logbook API Routes
4	 * ============================================================================
5	 *
6	 * Endpoints for the three-book aircraft maintenance logbook system
7	 * (Airframe, Engine, Propeller). Provides the full lifecycle of maintenance
8	 * records per 14 CFR Part 43.
9	 *
10	 * Routes:
11	 *  GET  /aircraft-logbook/:equipmentId/logbooks          — 3 logbooks + stats
12	 *  GET  /aircraft-logbook/:logbookId/entries             — paginated entries
13	 *  POST /aircraft-logbook/:logbookId/entries             — create entry
14	 *  GET  /aircraft-logbook/entries/:entryId               — single entry detail
15	 *  PUT  /aircraft-logbook/entries/:entryId               — update unsigned entry
16	 *  POST /aircraft-logbook/entries/:entryId/approve       — approve auto-draft
17	 *  POST /aircraft-logbook/entries/:entryId/amendments    — add amendment
18	 *  POST /aircraft-logbook/:logbookId/export              — export PDF (stub)
19	 * ============================================================================
20	 */
